<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in; text-align: right; text-indent: 380.85pt"><B>AtlasClear
Holdings,&nbsp;Inc.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: right; text-indent: -0.5in"><B>2203 Lois Avenue,</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: right; text-indent: -0.5in"><B>Suite&nbsp;814</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right"><B>Tampa, FL 33607</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>NOTICE OF SPECIAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">[ ], 2024</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Dear Stockholder:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">It is my pleasure to invite you to attend AtlasClear
Holdings,&nbsp;Inc.&rsquo;s (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;) special meeting of stockholders (as may be adjourned, the &ldquo;<B>Special
Meeting</B>&rdquo;). The Special Meeting will be held on [ ], 2024, at 10:00 a.m.&nbsp;local time at the offices of Greenberg Traurig,
LLP, located at 1750 Tysons Boulevard, Suite&nbsp;1000, McLean, Virginia 22102. At the Special Meeting, you will be asked:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">1.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the issuance of up to an aggregate of up
    to 75,000,000 shares of cmmon stock of the Company, par value $0.0001 per share (the &ldquo;<B>Common Stock</B>&rdquo;), to the sellers
    of Wilson-Davis&nbsp;&amp; Co.,&nbsp;Inc. (&ldquo;<B>Wilson-Davis</B>&rdquo;), pursuant to amendments to the Stock Purchase Agreement,
    dated as of April, 15, 2022, by and among Wilson-Davis, all of its stockholders (the &ldquo;<B>Wilson-Davis Sellers</B>&rdquo;) and
    the Company (as amended, the &ldquo;<B>Broker-Dealer Acquisition Agreement</B>&rdquo;) pursuant to which the Company issued short-term
    convertible promissory notes (the &ldquo;<B>Short-Term Seller Notes</B>&rdquo;) and long-term convertible promissory notes (the &ldquo;<B>Long-Term
    Seller Notes</B>&rdquo; and, collectively with the Short-Term Seller Notes, the &ldquo;<B>Seller Notes</B>&rdquo;) to the Wilson-Davis
    Sellers, which amount would be in excess of 19.99% of the issued and outstanding shares of the Company&rsquo;s Common Stock, in accordance
    with NYSE American Rule&nbsp;713(a)(ii)&nbsp;(the &ldquo;<B>Wilson-Davis Stock Issuance Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">2.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the issuance of up to 39,282,309 shares of Common Stock
    that may become issuable to Chardan Capital Markets LLC (&ldquo;<B>Chardan</B>&rdquo;) pursuant to a promissory note in the aggregate
    principal amount of $5,209,764 (as amended, the &ldquo;<B>Chardan Note</B>&rdquo;), which amount would be in excess of 19.99% of
    the issued and outstanding shares of the Company&rsquo;s Common Stock, in accordance with NYSE American Rule&nbsp;713(a)(ii)&nbsp;(the
    &ldquo;<B>Chardan Stock Issuance Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">3.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the issuance of up to 120,000,000 shares of Common Stock
    that may become issuable to Funicular Funds, LP (&ldquo;<B>Funicular</B>&rdquo;), pursuant to the Securities Purchase Agreement,
    dated as of February&nbsp;9, 2024, between AtlasClear Holdings and Quantum (the &ldquo;<B>Funicular Purchase Agreement</B>&rdquo;),
    pursuant to which the Company issued to Funicular a secured convertible promissory note (the &ldquo;<B>Funicular Note</B>&rdquo;)
    in the amount of $6,000,000 in a private placement, which amount would be in excess of 19.99% of the issued and outstanding shares
    of the Company&rsquo;s Common Stock, in accordance with NYSE American Rule&nbsp;713(a)(ii)&nbsp;(the &ldquo;<B>Funicular Stock Issuance
    Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">4.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the issuance of up to 11,623,235 shares of Common Stock
    that may become issuable to Winston&nbsp;&amp; Strawn LLP (&ldquo;<B>Winston&nbsp;&amp; Strawn</B>&rdquo;), pursuant to a subscription
    agreement, dated as of February&nbsp;9, 2024, between Winston&nbsp;&amp; Strawn and the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Winston&nbsp;&amp;
    Strawn Agreement</B>&rdquo;), which amount would be in excess of 19.99% of the issued and outstanding shares of the Company&rsquo;s
    Common Stock, in accordance with NYSE American Rule&nbsp;713(a)(ii)&nbsp;(the &ldquo;<B>Winston&nbsp;&amp; Strawn Stock Issuance
    Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 3 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">5.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">To approve
    the issuance of up to 10,000,000 shares of Common Stock that may be issued to an investor, Tau Investment Partners LLC (&ldquo;<B>Tau</B>&rdquo;),
    pursuant to an at-the-market agreement entered into between the Company and Tau, dated as of July&nbsp;31, 2024 (the &ldquo;<B>ELOC
    Agreement</B>&rdquo;), which amount would be in excess of 19.99% of the issued and outstanding shares of the Company&rsquo;s Common
    Stock, in accordance with NYSE American Rule&nbsp;713(a)(ii)&nbsp;(the &ldquo;<B>Tau Stock Issuance Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top"><TD STYLE="width: 48px"> &nbsp; </TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px; font-size: 10pt"> <FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">6.</FONT> </TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"> To approve an amendment to the Company&rsquo;s Amended and Restated Certificate
    of Incorporation to effect a reclassification and conversion of each outstanding share of Common Stock into one-third of a share
    of Common Stock (e.g., a 1-for-3 reverse stock split) in the form attached as Annex 1 (&ldquo;Reverse Stock Split Amendment&rdquo;),
    and authorize our Board of Directors to implement or abandon the Reverse Stock Split Amendment no later than November 30, 2025 (the
    &ldquo;<B>Reverse Stock Split Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and </TD></TR>
  </TABLE>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 48px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">7.</FONT></TD>
