    an amendment to the AtlasClear Holdings, Inc. 2024 Equity Incentive Plan (the &ldquo;<B>Plan</B>&rdquo;) (the &ldquo;<B>Equity Incentive
    Plan Amendment Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
