    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve the issuance of 39,282,309 shares of Common
    Stock that may become issuable to Chardan Capital Markets LLC (&ldquo;<B>Chardan</B>&rdquo;) pursuant to a promissory note in the
    aggregate principal amount of $5,209,764 (as amended, the &ldquo;<B>Chardan Note</B>&rdquo;), which amount would be in excess of
    19.99% of the issued and outstanding shares of the Company&rsquo;s Common Stock, in accordance with NYSE American Rule&nbsp;713(a)(ii)&nbsp;(the
    &ldquo;<B>Chardan Stock Issuance Proposal</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
